---
<div class="pt-24 md:pt-32">
  <div class="ls-shell max-w-[1000px] mx-auto">
    <h2 class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.1] mb-8">Concrete applications.</h2>

    <p class="text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Showing concrete applications rather than abstract AI terminology.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)] mb-3">Financial Services</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-1">
          <li>Customer operations</li>
          <li>Credit workflows</li>
          <li>Risk intelligence</li>
          <li>Collections</li>
          <li>Decision support</li>
          <li>Digital channels</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)] mb-3">Enterprise Operations</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-1">
          <li>Workflow automation</li>
          <li>Reporting</li>
          <li>PMO</li>
          <li>Knowledge management</li>
          <li>Executive intelligence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)] mb-3">Development Sector</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-1">
          <li>Programme intelligence</li>
          <li>Monitoring</li>
          <li>Research</li>
          <li>Data operations</li>
          <li>Field-to-decision workflows</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)] mb-3">Public Sector</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-1">
          <li>Service delivery</li>
          <li>Administrative automation</li>
          <li>Policy intelligence</li>
          <li>Responsible AI governance</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--ls-ink)] mb-3">Market Intelligence</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] space-y-1">
          <li>Research automation</li>
          <li>Intelligence systems</li>
          <li>Competitive monitoring</li>
          <li>Decision support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
